at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is printed and nothing else: a warning swallowed for repeating the room’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own dark line is still a warned turn."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The death this daemon deals is the lingering one, and the line has to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"say so.","type":"text"}]},{"text":" The first dark turn only warns, and the dice wait for dark turn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns + 2"},{"text":" — the third dark turn at the default grace of one, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"never earlier than dark turn 2, because dark turn 1 is the warning’s own","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"arm however low ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"graceTurns"},{"type":"text","text":" goes. So a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"death here lands on a turn spent lingering in a dark the player has"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"already been warned about, rather than on the turn the dark began —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"whether that later turn is a move or a wait.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Zork has two death sentences, and both belong to moves. "},{"code":"V-WALK","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gverbs.zil:1578"},{"type":"text","text":") says “You have walked into the slavering fangs of a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lurking grue!” and fires only on a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"blocked"}]},{"type":"text","text":" move in the dark, a mechanic"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"this plugin does not have at all; ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"GOTO"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"gverbs.zil:2110-2114"},{"text":") says","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"“A lurking grue slithered into “ and then the vehicle’s name, or the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"word “room”, “and devoured you!” — the grue comes to the player, so it is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the one that fits. Both games here had been handed the first. (#350)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"That branch is why ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/Text\/death"},{"text":" takes a subject: the vehicle the player was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"aboard, or nothing. Both halves are the game’s own words. A library that","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has never seen the game has no business deciding what to call the place","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"somebody was taken from, so the stock line names none.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustodangerousdark\/dangerousdark\/timers"]}],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoDangerousDark"}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"timers","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV","text":"TimedEvent","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"title":"timers","roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:19GnustoDangerousDark0bC0V6timersSay0A010TimedEventVGvp"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://GnustoDangerousDark/documentation/GnustoDangerousDark/DangerousDark/timers":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoDangerousDark\/documentation\/GnustoDangerousDark\/DangerousDark\/timers","url":"\/documentation\/gnu